  "scenario": "Marco is looking for a new job. He talks with his friend Laura about the requirements: he has to go to an interview, he needs to sign a contract, and he has to ask his employer about his responsibilities. Laura gives him advice about what is required for the position.",
  "introduction_md": "En esta lección vas a aprender a hablar sobre los requisitos de un trabajo. Vas a usar **have to** para expresar obligaciones: *I have to go to an interview* (Tengo que ir a una entrevista).\n\nVas a practicar con vocabulario útil: **interview** (entrevista), **colleague** (compañero de trabajo), **employer** (empleador), **contract** (contrato), **required** (requerido) y **responsibility** (responsabilidad).\n\nAl final, vas a poder:\n\n- Hablar de lo que es necesario para un trabajo.\n- Preguntar y responder sobre obligaciones laborales.\n- Discutir requisitos con un compañero o empleador.\n\n¡Vamos a practicar con situaciones reales de trabajo!",
  "intro_target": "In this lesson, you will learn to talk about job requirements. You will use **have to** to express obligations: *I have to go to an interview*.\n\nYou will practice with useful vocabulary: **interview**, **colleague**, **employer**, **contract**, **required**, and **responsibility**.\n\nBy the end, you will be able to:\n\n- Talk about what is necessary for a job.\n- Ask and answer questions about job obligations.\n- Discuss requirements with a colleague or employer.\n\nLet's practice with real work situations!",
